#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:5
msgid "WooCommerce Importer"
msgstr "WooCommerce-importør"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:14
msgid ""
"Your WooCommerce store has been imported to the EasyCart. There are no "
"guarantees that all options have been imported, becuase Woo offers so many "
"extensions. Please check over the data and manually add anything that may be "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"Din WooCommerce-butik er blevet importeret til EasyCart. Der er ingen "
"garantier for, at alle muligheder er importeret, da Woo tilbyder så mange "
"udvidelser. Kontroller dataene, og tilføj manuelt alt, hvad der mangler."

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:24
msgid ""
"Importing your data from your WooCommerce store is as simple as a click of a "
"button! Although we do our best to import your data, not everything is "
"transferrable or is known about all extensions available to the Woo system. "
"The following information is imported by our system:"
msgstr ""
"Import af dine data fra din WooCommerce-butik er så simpelt som et klik på "
"en knap! Selvom vi gør vores bedste for at importere dine data, er ikke alt "
"overførbart eller er kendt om alle udvidelser, der er tilgængelige for Woo-"
"systemet. Følgende oplysninger importeres af vores system:"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:26
msgid "Woo Product Categories"
msgstr "Woo produktkategorier"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:27
msgid "Woo Attributes are imported as option sets to our system"
msgstr "Woo-attributter importeres som optionssæt til vores system"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:28
msgid "Woo Products are imported by the following rules:"
msgstr "Woo-produkter importeres efter følgende regler:"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:29
msgid ""
"Title, Description, Short Description, Price (Sale/Regular), Allow Comments, "
"Taxable, Download, Service Item (Virtual), SKU, Download File, Download "
"Limit, Download Expiry, Manage Stock, Stock Status, Stock Quantity"
msgstr ""
"Titel, beskrivelse, kort beskrivelse, pris (salg / almindelig), tillad "
"kommentarer, afgiftspligtig, download, servicevare (virtuel), SKU, download "
"fil, downloadgrænse, download udløb, administrer lager, lagerstatus, "
"lagermængde"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:30
msgid ""
"Connects Imported Attributes (now option sets) to products the same as Woo "
"has connected."
msgstr ""
"Forbinder importerede attributter (nu indstillingssæt) til produkter, der er "
"de samme som Woo har tilsluttet."

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:31
msgid "Connects Product Categories to Products."
msgstr "Forbinder produktkategorier til produkter."

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:32
msgid "If no SKU available, random model number is created."
msgstr "Hvis der ikke findes nogen SKU, oprettes tilfældigt modelnummer."

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:33
msgid "Product images are copied into our system from WordPress upload system"
msgstr "Produktbilleder kopieres til vores system fra WordPress-uploadsystemet"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:34
msgid "Limited to 5 images and first 5 of image gallery used"
msgstr "Begrænset til 5 billeder og de første 5 i billedgalleriet brugt"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:35
msgid "If no image gallery, uses featured image"
msgstr "Hvis der ikke er noget billedgalleri, bruger det featured billede"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:43
msgid "IMPORT WooCommerce DATA NOW"
msgstr "IMPORT WooCommerce DATA NU"

#: admin/template/settings/cart-importer/woo-import.php:48
msgid ""
"We cannot detect a version of WooCommerce installed, which may mean that "
"this section does not apply to your site or WooCommerce has been "
"deactivated. In order for us to complete a successful import from "
"WooCommerce, we need a copy of WooCommerce Installed and activated on your "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Vi kan ikke registrere en version af WooCommerce installeret, hvilket kan "
"betyde, at dette afsnit ikke gælder for dit websted, eller at WooCommerce er "
"blevet deaktiveret. For at vi kan gennemføre en vellykket import fra "
"WooCommerce, har vi brug for en kopi af WooCommerce installeret og aktiveret "
"på dit websted."

