"valgte land (foretrukken metode)."

#: admin/template/settings/checkout/checkout-form-settings.php:27
msgid "State: Change with Country"
msgstr "Vælg land"

#: admin/template/settings/checkout/checkout-form-settings.php:27
msgid "The state box updates based on the country selected (preferred method)."
msgstr ""
"Tilstandsboksen opdateres baseret på det valgte land (foretrukken metode)."

#: admin/template/settings/checkout/checkout-form-settings.php:29
msgid "State: Combo Box"
msgstr "Avanceret: kombinationsboks"

