"Enabling guest checkout gives users the option to submit an order without a "
"password or account (some products require accounts such as downloads, "
"subscriptions, or gift cards)"
msgstr ""
"Aktivering af gæstebetaling giver brugerne mulighed for at afgive en ordre "
"uden en adgangskode eller konto (nogle produkter kræver konti, f.eks. "
"downloads, abonnementer eller gavekort)"

#: admin/template/settings/checkout/checkout-schedule.php:5
msgid "Checkout Schedule Settings"
