msgid "Preorder Pickup: Distance Format"
msgstr "Afhentning af forudbestilling: Distance-format"

#: admin/template/settings/checkout/checkout-schedule.php:29
msgid "Choose standard or metric display for your location distances."
msgstr "Vælg standard eller metrisk visning for dine placeringsafstande."

#: admin/template/settings/checkout/checkout-schedule.php:31
msgid "Google API Key"
msgstr "Google API-nøgle"

#: admin/template/settings/checkout/checkout-schedule.php:31
msgid ""
"This is required to allow geocoding of user searches and automatic geocoding "
"of your locations. If you leave blank, you will need to lookup your location "
"lat and long manually."
msgstr ""
"Dette er nødvendigt for at tillade geokodning af brugersøgninger og "
"automatisk geokodning af dine placeringer. Hvis du lader den stå tom, skal "
"du slå din placerings lat og long op manuelt."

