#: admin/template/settings/pricepoint/pricepoint-details.php:27
msgid "Price Point Setup"
msgstr "Opsætning af prispunkt"

#: admin/template/settings/pricepoint/pricepoint-details.php:29
msgid ""
"Price Points let you create a collection of products that exist within a "
"price range and set those price points.  Here you can create greater than, "
"less than, or between price range groups.  This is especially useful if you "
"use our price point widget to allow customers to filter based on price "
"points."
msgstr ""
"Prispoint giver dig mulighed for at oprette en samling af produkter, der "
"findes inden for et prisinterval, og indstille disse prispoint. Her kan du "
"oprette større end, mindre end eller mellem prisklasser. Dette er især "
"nyttigt, hvis du bruger vores prispunktswidget til at give kunder mulighed "
"for at filtrere baseret på prispoint."

#: admin/template/settings/pricepoint/pricepoint-details.php:30
msgid ""
"Note: There should only be one Less Than price point and one Greater Than "
"price point. All the rest should be filled in and cover the range of zero "
"(0.00) to infinity."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk: Der bør kun være et mindre end prispunktet og et større end "
"prispunktet. Resten skal udfyldes og dække området fra nul (0,00) til "
"uendelig."

