msgstr "Gem standardindstillinger: Aktivér placeringer i sidepanelet"

#: admin/template/settings/products/product-store-defaults.php:75
msgid "Enable this to show a pickup location selector in your sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Aktivér dette for at vise en valgmulighed for afhentningssted i din sidebar."

