msgstr "Lagre standardindstillinger: Komplekse kategorifiltre"

#: admin/template/settings/products/product-store-defaults.php:87
msgid "Enable this to show category filters in your sidebar."
msgstr "Aktiver dette for at vise kategorifiltre i din sidebar."

#: admin/template/settings/products/product-store-defaults.php:89
msgid "Store Defaults: Category Top Level"
msgstr "Lagre standardindstillinger: Kategori øverste niveau"

#: admin/template/settings/products/product-store-defaults.php:89
msgid ""
"Select the top level to server as a category filter. Sub-categories will "
"become groups that may be selected and sub-sub-categories become the "
"selectable items."
msgstr ""
"Vælg det øverste niveau til serveren som et kategorifilter. Underkategorier "
