"Dette er nødvendigt for at validere dine momsregistreringsnumre og angive en "
"brugerdefineret sats for virksomheder."

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:51
msgid "Default Rate"
msgstr "Standard"

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:51
msgid ""
"This is the percent to apply by default to orders, for global this is the "
"rate that will be charged."
msgstr ""
"Dette er den procentdel, der som standard skal gælde for ordrer, for globalt "
"er dette den sats, der vil blive opkrævet."

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:53
msgid "Business Rate"
msgstr "FORRETNING"

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:53
msgid ""
"This is the VAT rate charged to those that enter a VAT registration number."
msgstr ""
"Dette er den momssats, der opkræves af dem, der angiver et "
"momsregistreringsnummer."

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:55
msgid "Default Rounding"
msgstr "Standard"

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:55
msgid ""
"This is the rounding point for tax, most use .01, but some countries require "
"rounding by .05 or other."
msgstr ""
"Dette er afrundingspunktet for skat, de fleste bruger 0,01, men nogle lande "
"kræver afrunding med 0,05 eller andre."

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:59
msgid "VAT Country Rates"
msgstr "Momslandesatser"

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:60
msgid ""
"This feature pulls the VAT rate from the country once the user enters their "
"country on checkout. All countries have rates, but zero rates do not show in "
"this list. Default rate only applies before the customer provides their "
"country in checkout."
msgstr ""
"Denne funktion henter momssatsen fra landet, når brugeren indtaster sit land "
"ved kassen. Alle lande har satser, men nulsatser vises ikke på denne liste. "
"Standardsatsen gælder kun, før kunden angiver sit land i kassen."

#: admin/template/settings/taxes/vat-setup.php:84
msgid "Apply to Business"
msgstr "Anvend på business"

