msgstr "Se din butik"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/complete.php:36
msgid "EMAIL RELIABILITY"
msgstr "E-MAIL PÅLIDELIGHED"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/complete.php:37
msgid ""
"Did you know that order and cart based emails rely on WordPress to send? "
"Most servers are pretty bad at sending email, so it is important for you to "
"test before going live. We have lots of info to help you get going, "
"including several great recommendations to improve email delivery to your "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"Vidste du, at ordre- og indkøbsvognsbaserede e-mails er afhængige af "
"WordPress for at blive sendt? De fleste servere er ret dårlige til at sende "
"e-mails, så det er vigtigt at teste, før du går live. Vi har masser af info "
"til at hjælpe dig i gang, herunder flere gode anbefalinger til at forbedre e-"
"mailleveringen til dine kunder."

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/complete.php:46
msgid "NEXT STEP"
msgstr "NÆSTE"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/complete.php:47
