#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:5
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your store needs a few pages to operate. The following pages have %salready "
"been created automatically%s for you (if they did not already exist)."
msgstr ""
"Din butik har brug for et par sider for at fungere. De følgende sider er %s "
"allerede oprettet automatisk %s til dig (hvis de ikke allerede eksisterede)."

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:8
msgid "This is where your customers will enter your store and begin shopping."
msgstr "Det er her dine kunder kommer ind i din butik og begynder at shoppe."

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:12
#: inc/classes/widget/ec_cartwidget.php:13
#: inc/classes/widget/ec_cartwidget.php:19
msgid "Shopping Cart"
msgstr "Indkøbskurv"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:13
msgid "This page displays the shopping cart and checkout to the customer."
msgstr "Denne side viser indkøbskurven og kassen til kunden."

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:17
msgid "My Account"
msgstr "Min konto"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:18
msgid ""
"This page displays the customer's account, order history, and other "
"information."
msgstr "Denne side viser kundens konto, ordrehistorik og andre oplysninger."

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:22
#, php-format
msgid ""
"We recommend adding your store, account, and cart to your menu. You can show "
"these pages on your site by adding them to your menu via %s Appearance >> "
"Menus %s"
msgstr ""
"Vi anbefaler at tilføje din butik, konto og indkøbskurv til din menu. Du kan "
"vise disse sider på dit websted ved at føje dem til din menu via %s Udseende "
">> Menuer %s"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:27
msgid "Cache Compatibility"
msgstr "Cache-kompatibilitet"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:28
msgid ""
"Caching is the process of serving a snapshot of a page to every user, which "
"makes your site fast! The problem is that a shopping cart needs to display "
"something different for each customer. EasyCart has that handled by loading "
"your cart and account dynamically. Keep this feature on for best "
"compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Caching er processen med at servere et øjebliksbillede af en side til hver "
"bruger, hvilket gør dit websted hurtigt! Problemet er, at en indkøbskurv "
"skal vise noget andet for hver kunde. EasyCart håndterer det ved at indlæse "
"din indkøbskurv og konto dynamisk. Hold denne funktion tændt for at få den "
"bedste kompatibilitet."

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:37
msgid "SSL &amp; Secure Sites"
msgstr "SSL og sikre websteder"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:38
msgid ""
"SSL Certificates are what make the connection between your customer and your "
"cart secure. You will need to get one from your hosting provider to securely "
"process credit cards and may cost you extra. The good news is that once "
"installed, everyone will see a nice secure lock in their browser. We "
"recommend leaving this setting on to automatically force your EasyCart into "
"a secure state. If you see a warning in the browser, you'll know to get an "
"SSL certificate from your host."
msgstr ""
"SSL-certifikater er det, der gør forbindelsen mellem din kunde og din kurv "
"sikker. Du bliver nødt til at få en fra din hostingudbyder til sikker "
"behandling af kreditkort og kan koste dig ekstra. Den gode nyhed er, at når "
"de er installeret, vil alle se en god sikker lås i deres browser. Vi "
"anbefaler at lade denne indstilling være aktiveret for automatisk at tvinge "
"din EasyCart til en sikker tilstand. Hvis du ser en advarsel i browseren, "
"ved du at få et SSL-certifikat fra din vært."

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:47
msgid "SEO Friendly Links"
msgstr "Links til SEO-venlige"

#: admin/template/settings/wizard/page-setup.php:48
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Permalinks are what WordPress calls SEO Friendly links and the EasyCart "
"offers this to those that have the correct server setup. We recommend this "
"option because it will turn store links from %s to %s, which search engines "
"love! If you turn this on and notice an issue accessing your products, "
"contact us for help!"
msgstr ""
"Permalinks er, hvad WordPress kalder SEO-venlige links, og EasyCart tilbyder "
"dette til dem, der har den korrekte serveropsætning. Vi anbefaler denne "
"mulighed, fordi den vil vende butikslinks fra %s til %s, som søgemaskiner "
"elsker! Hvis du tænder for dette og bemærker et problem med at få adgang til "
"dine produkter, skal du kontakte os for hjælp!"

