#, php-format
msgid ""
"WP EasyCart offers both online and offline payments. %s Additional payment "
"methods %s can be installed later."
msgstr ""
"WP EasyCart tilbyder både online og offline betalinger. %s Yderligere "
"betalingsmetoder %s kan installeres senere."

