#: admin/template/settings/wizard/shipping.php:5
msgid ""
"WP EasyCart offers static shipping rates, weight based rates, cart total "
"based rates, and a few more by default. You can upgrade to PRO and activate "
"live shipping rates with UPS, USPS, FedEx, DHL, CanadaPost, or Australia "
